{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45428","headline":"贺王起 · 广宣","name":"贺王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从辞凤阁掌丝纶，便向青云领贡宾。\n再辟文场无枉路，两开金榜绝冤人。\n眼看龙化门前水，手放莺飞谷口春。\n明日定归台席去，鶺鴒原上共陶钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}